O_sRLFjJTx7vlPgwbpWXsb9olR0R0d4h1P3bF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5T3BwyXtwjvJZFpNm8qQRmZFFxJwhwvN3Pychpn9yEtA&oe=6A1D92F2"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "296114026862324", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_296114030195657_275861733805151497_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zyT0lCDbm24Q7kNvwFglwvl&_nc_oc=AdppvHA3XWb665OlBNRfG4glte17WF9PYjyAi6vM9dA-1Jc19Qo1PNMUamrRya7TSEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6MZ8ZMFnNOSyRhxicaF2UKIu64J_o6pFV0q5I04ClXoA&oe=6A1D9E21"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "802537541948419", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210889_802537548615085_7583608226087987807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DHtkyJnyrxAQ7kNvwFtHsz7&_nc_oc=Adoxpxx381YOMJ4BzZ33okwP8wIE9jL3q26wiOFAT4lFO_l3jpJ-LKXs0QKZdIMjotE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4IT6XBko2GzB5Lg_Ni8ikFVcBLhL2OIvCIjZ4w68CHxw&oe=6A1D93EE"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "1952004381931095", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75298472_1952004385264428_8213665801664121384_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jc_JlNgiN8oQ7kNvwEq8lRs&_nc_oc=Adp2t7dzZKHHwpFD73pZik93IejVvoPeT45yiKi26VF7ISZUESXaSpZj0LzmovhClJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4zU-BVgQJd-LGI_tyA1QA-IFRfdZi0f-VQ9mf1PSVKmQ&oe=6A1D79AC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "7841830009239208", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035410_7841830012572541_6800934679758716826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zazaa8Itt5oQ7kNvwFGv-H4&_nc_oc=Adr1O6M-km5KsYZwmj7KStybTJmi7PXQ5g86-UBThq_dHBN7XlXlbn5h0MiHqAL3jMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7RhyHRUocFJm1ZT-FSk_B1RzrpU8u0CYrSU3lJhZxXwg&oe=6A1DA613"}, "display_name": "Orb Conquest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges.\nGameplay Overview\n\nIn \"Orb Conquest,\" players are transported to a visually stunning, high-tech environment filled with neon-lit paths and mesmerizing graphics. The game mechanics are designed to test and enhance your coordination and problem-solving skills. Each level presents a unique maze-like track, teeming with hurdles that require quick thinking and precise movements to overcome.\nKey Features\n\n    Dynamic Spheres: Master the control of highly responsive spheres, each with unique attributes and abilities that you can unlock and upgrade as you progress.\n\n    Intricate Tracks: Navigate through a variety of complex and beautifully designed tracks. Each track offers different challenges, from narrow passages to moving barriers and beyond.", "short_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SGag2426 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_categ